# Secrets and credentials. Nothing in this repo needs an API key -- everything runs
# offline against a bundled deterministic model -- so anything matching these patterns
# arriving here is an accident, and the ignore list is the cheap half of not publishing it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
credentials.json
service-account*.json
secrets.json
.secrets/
*.secret
.aws/
.gcloud/
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.log

